IP-CIDR,172.253.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,162.159.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,74.125.0.0/16,no-resolve

# === 補充 ===
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ipinfo.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,iplark.com
